TI  - Behavioral Adaptive Autonomy. A milestone on the Alife  route to AI?
T2  - Artificial life IX: proceedings of the Ninth International Conference on the Simulation and Synthesis of Artificial Life
SP  - 514
EP  - 521
PB  - MIT Press
CY  - Cambridge, MA
